      "content": "i know, i know... everyone says that. but it doesnt change the numbers. my debt is growing, my job is unstable, and even just my being here eating food and taking up space costs money. i did the math. if i just disappeared, the savings would last twice as long. it's not even about being sad anymore, it just seems like the only logical way to help them actually get ahead.",
